# Witness for EpochMeetsCoreClaim. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - a claim by one of L's activations - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: EpochMeetsCoreClaimWitness
TARGET: EpochMeetsCoreClaim
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a claim by one of L's activations is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("EpochMeetsCoreClaim", CClaim(a))
--- REPLACE
Fails("EpochMeetsCoreClaim", FALSE)
--- END
